/**
 * Per-user-safe Smart Chart overlay model. Returns Ruby's signal geometry
(watch / entry / retest / late / invalidation / stop / take-profit) and
structure levels as drawable visual layers that stay CONSISTENT with
Ruby's text, plus a Market Impact Radar that maps events from a
connected, real economic-calendar provider onto the symbol (severity +
countdown), an honest news behavior note, reserved execution-cost and
trade-health overlay slots, and a data-side Smart Chart Overlay
Handshake. ADVISORY / VISUAL ONLY — it never places, modifies, or closes
a trade and never gates execution. HONEST: news is real or honestly
absent — when no real economic-calendar provider is connected the radar
shows no scheduled events (none are fabricated) and the read degrades to
technicals-only behavior, never fabricated events, headlines, or
results. Synthetic instruments never map to real-world events.

 * @summary Smart Chart Layers & Market Impact Radar for a symbol/timeframe (Task
 */
